        dct:description "12-frame 640x480 ocellus, CV 85.9 — docs/media/gasterosteus_doryssus_early_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-early-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/gif, 1398253 B, 640×480 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 c073ea955ccc8d6e9731f2cf1cc277370a55a1c013a5847a843c25e376f7772b (sha256 c073ea955ccc8d6e9731f2cf1cc277370a55a1c013a5847a843c25e376f7772b), spec_fingerprint 7da029c4116b272894d7e1440005167263445ac99716f78586b6bac5b2bee85e" .
